# Reference alphabet files for the molsig tool.
# Download the real .npz files from: https://zenodo.org/records/22691018
# Then edit the paths below to point to where you stored them on this instance.
#value	name	version path
#chembl	ChEMBL alphabet 1.0	/path/to/chembl_alphabet.npz
#drugbank	DrugBank alphabet   1.0	/path/to/drugbank_alphabet.npz
#emolecules	eMolecules alphabet 1.0	/path/to/emolecules_alphabet.npz
#metanetx	MetaNetX alphabet   1.0	/path/to/metanetx_alphabet.npz